# Cloudflare Pages headers (the public site, 11-07; GitHub Pages ignores this file).
# Hashed bundles never change under their name: cache them for a year. Everything else keeps Cloudflare's default
# (revalidated by ETag), because clips and their index.json are re-made under the same names as lip-sync arrives.
# The store apps stream the lands' media from this site, so media allows any origin (docs/store/NATIVE-BUILD.md).
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/adventure/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
/env/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
/koala/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
/koala_k3d/*
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
